Bundled balloon detection model
================================

manga_models/bubble.onnx is an ONNX export (made by this project, fixed
1600x1600 input) of the Ultralytics YOLO11n instance-segmentation weights
"best.pt" from:

    huyvux3005/manga109-segmentation-bubble
    https://huggingface.co/huyvux3005/manga109-segmentation-bubble

Trained by the MangaLens authors on MS92/MangaSegmentation and Manga109.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE next to
this file. No modifications were made to the weights themselves; the export
only fixes the input shape and opset.

These weights are a separate work from the rest of this package, which is
MIT licensed (see the repository root LICENSE).

Ultralytics YOLO software is licensed under AGPL-3.0. This project does not
bundle or import Ultralytics: runtime inference uses onnxruntime only.
